    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      399.67,
      286.68,
      453.43
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the Government intends to acquire the following lands which are required for purpose to B/Soraguna Maha Vidyalaya.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      0.9599039554595947,
      5.9994001388549805,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      50.88,
      454.87,
      286.68,
      561.68
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land to be acquired: The allotments of lands situated in the Grama Niladhari Division of Madawela (157-F), Village of Mahawela, in the Minor Division of Kandapalla Korale, Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Haldummulla, Badulla District in Uva Province depicted in FVP 45 Supplementary No. 4 and Sheet No. 5 and dated 31.12.2008 prepared by the Surveyor-General, containing in Extent 0.2802 Hectare and described as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      4.079591751098633,
      10.078991889953613
    ]
  },
